# ── Environment ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ADD OS: was `.env` alone, which does NOT match `.env.production` — so the
# production file, and the credential it carried, was committable. Ignore every
# env file and allow only the documented template through.
#
# Enforced by src/add-os/__tests__/no-secrets.spec.ts.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example


